<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0715_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Krise</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You...\nYou think I’m fine, right?\rSo how ’bout we swap\nnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t trip, you can call me anytime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I see...\nMaybe I was overthinkin’...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I knew it! I KNEW you thought I\nwas fine!\rSo, shall we swap\nnumbers now? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You must be REAL shy.\nIf you nearby, you can come talk to\fme in person. It’s aight.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My prized {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} doin’ great.\rWhich homie you like best?\nYou should show me sometime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, listen up!\nYesterday we was fightin’ a wild\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rI used a Hennessy at the\nwrong moment, and it looked like we\fgon’ lose.\rMy homie went SO hard. I deadass\nwanted to win, you know?\rWell, stuff like that happen,\nI guess.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You keep all the homies you\ncatch in PC Boxes?\rMe, I usually just let ’em go...\rThat reminds me, I recently let this\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} go...\rThat’s kinda a waste, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, what you think about scrappin’\nme again?\rI’m at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}\nright now.\rC’mon over!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup?\nYou remember your promise?\rWe gotta scrap soon!\nI’ll be at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It wasn’t real smart to come to\nthe Park in a miniskirt, was it...?\rI mean, these leaves keep scratchin’\nmy legs...</language>
	</row>
</body>
